{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 4773, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 8893, "uid": 50, "type": 4, "title": "快速提升战力", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1543549575, "updated_at": 1589421852, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1562231935, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 60, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 79865, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 2, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 4773, "content": "提升一个天命之子的实际战力的途径有：<div>1. 突破</div><div id=\"false\">吃掉相同的天命卡，可以获得突破+1，最高可以到达+6。</div><div id=\"false\">附上一张图，作为突破指数的战力参考。</div><div id=\"false\"><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/0D/92/ChpCl1wF_QWEY18gAAAAAHz_8M8925.png\"></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div>2. 温泉（韩服）</div><div>夜世界温泉模式开放之后，可以通过泡温泉来提升天命之子的属性。关于温泉有词条详细介绍，这里不多赘述。</div><div><br></div><div>3. 好感</div><div>提升天命的好感度可以提高天命的战力，这里提升的优先级排序为：</div><div>攻击&gt;控制&gt;盾&gt;治疗&gt;辅助</div><div>提升好感推荐先直接横向提升到S，在第一个主力队伍全S以后，再提升到满好感。（韩服）</div><div>国际服因为有等级限制，提升好感度点满所有能点的，优先级顺序依旧是先点攻击，随后<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">控制&gt;盾&gt;治疗&gt;辅助。</span></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div>4. 等级与升星</div><div id=\"false\">提升等级的主要途径有刷图和吃max史莱姆。</div><div id=\"false\">吃max史莱姆就不过多叙述了，这里主要说一下刷图的一个技巧。</div><div id=\"false\">游戏里韩服每天会有一个hot time，一般国内是从晚上6点到8点，在这期间刷图给的经验值会高很多；国际服是周末两天时间hot time。</div><div id=\"false\">如果体力够用的话，此时刷图不要选难度最高的本，要以获取最多经验为目的，这涉及到一点点算数知识。即如果此时你打高难度副本，需要花费3分钟，获得经验为400，但是打中等难度副本，花费时间1分钟，获得经验为200，那请选择中等难度的副本打。</div><div id=\"false\">附上主线耗费体力与获得的经验表作为参考</div><div><img src=\"//cdnimg01.gamekee.com/M00/0D/92/ChpCl1wF-yiECrz5AAAAANHZI7Y854.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 253px;\"></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div>5. 装备</div><div>穿戴装备可以提升天命的战斗力，S好感后开启第三个饰品装备栏，满好感后开启背景卡装备栏。</div><div>装备本身自带星级和ABCDE品质，可以升级到+15，可以进行镶嵌和洗属性。有装备词条，这里不过多赘述。</div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\"></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 50, "username": "有瓜子的仓鼠", "avatar": "//cdnimg02.gamekee.com/M00/0C/2B/ChpCl1tr6DyEZfJMAAAAANul3Ss057.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 12, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 377, "read_num": 1179569, "like_num": 876}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4, "icon": "//c